id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"fKAxmycMFwO9qWVUAOQzOw","review_id":"Etd5tMs7VWRY-mP3tS3k6g","date":"2019-06-09T05:32:13","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9383289217948914,"text_excerpt":"Yum! I came here with my friend today and really enjoyed my pizza. I got the margarita on thin crust. The crust was good and crispy, there was a perfect amount of cheese and the tomatoes were fresh. It wasn't a true margarita pizza but it was good. It also wasn't too heavy-I actually left feeling comfortably full. We ate outside and it's on a nice block with lots of pretty live oak trees so I really enjoyed being around the pretty foliage and people watching while eating my pizza. It was also happy hour when we went. I was driving so I didn't drink, but they had really good specials. Really good as in $2 mimosas (this was at 5pm). So now I know that for next time. I'm so happy my friend t..."},{"business_id":"fKAxmycMFwO9qWVUAOQzOw","review_id":"uXVSn7Xat0h5O8WUSwZzpQ","date":"2021-01-29T23:40:04","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9300596714019775,"text_excerpt":"I ABSOLUTELY LOVE THIS PLACE!! Literally, my favorite pizza spot in New Orleans. I can't express how real it gets behind Gs. I always order a chicken pizza with jalapeño peppers, bacon, pineapples and bbq sauce drizzle. My mouth is watering just thinking of the explosion of flavors in my mouth lol. I also love to order the cheesy jalapeño sticks and the salad (can't think of the name) but it comes with an abundance amount of advocacy, walnuts, strawberry's and feta cheese. The portions are great and the prices are so reasonable for QUALITY food."},{"business_id":"fKAxmycMFwO9qWVUAOQzOw","review_id":"z1SleN60whUZfYFzfthP-A","date":"2018-08-15T02:45:58","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9300585985183716,"text_excerpt":"This is by far my favorite pizza spot, since it opened several years ago. It's in my neighborhood, so I often get something to go. The best thing about G's is that they run daily specials. The Monday Family special is hard to beat. You get a large specialty pizza, appetizer and salad for $25. They let you totally customize the pizzas, so you can pile the toppings on free of charge. They offer some of the best varieties of pizzas anywhere that will pacify the pickiest of vegetarians or carnivores, with an emphasis on integrating different cultures. The gyro pizza and the philly steak are two of my faves. The appetizers are amazing too, especially the spinach artichoke dip. More than once, ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"fKAxmycMFwO9qWVUAOQzOw","photo_id":"vgPMMRfzBofOVP4CRDxhyg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/vgPMMRfzBofOVP4CRDxhyg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9005650281906128},{"business_id":"fKAxmycMFwO9qWVUAOQzOw","photo_id":"imSWCpMG4LmsfN4M2z42nA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/imSWCpMG4LmsfN4M2z42nA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8525493144989014},{"business_id":"fKAxmycMFwO9qWVUAOQzOw","photo_id":"siDrsCEoR-kCdf6GmnqF7A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/siDrsCEoR-kCdf6GmnqF7A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7875804901123047},{"business_id":"fKAxmycMFwO9qWVUAOQzOw","photo_id":"sIxlIZ7VV74d30yqbHLtTA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/sIxlIZ7VV74d30yqbHLtTA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7449488639831543},{"business_id":"fKAxmycMFwO9qWVUAOQzOw","photo_id":"itIQwMYgFIoBpc4dxcVrhw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/itIQwMYgFIoBpc4dxcVrhw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7422887086868286}]},"notebook_case":null}
